        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram Tong Hop - Quan ly Ban hang\n\nautonumber\nactor \&quot;Nhan vien ban hang\&quot; as NV\nboundary \&quot;Giao dien Ban hang\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Ban hang Controller\&quot; as Ctrl\nentity \&quot;Sach &amp; Ton kho\&quot; as SachEntity\nentity \&quot;Khuyen mai\&quot; as KMEntity\nentity \&quot;Hoa don &amp; Giao dich\&quot; as HDEntity\n\nactivate NV\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; GROUP 1: QUY TRINH BAN HANG (UC 1, 2, 3, 4)\n&#39; ==========================================\ngroup 1. Quy trinh Ban hang (Tra cuu, Lap hoa don, Khuyen mai &amp; Thanh toan)\n    \n    &#39; UC 1: Tra cứu sách bán\n    NV -&gt; UI: Nhap tu khoa (Ten, Ma, The loai...) hoac Quet ma vach\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl: traCuuSach(tuKhoa)\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&gt; SachEntity: queryThongTinVaTonKho(tuKhoa)\n    activate SachEntity\n    \n    alt Khong tim thay sach\n        SachEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve NULL\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Bao loi \&quot;Khong tim thay sach\&quot;\n    else Tim thay sach\n        SachEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve thong tin sach &amp; ton kho\n        deactivate SachEntity\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi thong tin sach\n    end\n    deactivate Ctrl\n    \n    &#39; UC 2: Xem chi tiết giỏ hàng / hóa đơn tạm\n    NV -&gt; UI: Them vao gio hang &amp; dieu chinh so luong (+/-)\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl: updateGioHang(maSach, soLuong)\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&gt; SachEntity: checkTonKho(maSach, soLuong)\n    activate SachEntity\n    \n    alt So luong vuot ton kho\n        SachEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Ton kho khong du\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Canh bao \&quot;So luong ton khong du\&quot; &amp; dua ve muc toi da\n    else Ton kho hop le\n        SachEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Hop le\n        deactivate SachEntity\n        \n        &#39; UC 3: Áp dụng khuyến mãi vào hóa đơn\n        Ctrl -&gt; KMEntity: quetChuongTrinhKhuyenMai(gioHang)\n        activate KMEntity\n        KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve muc giam tru (Chiet khau)\n        deactivate KMEntity\n        \n        opt Khach hang co ma giam gia (Voucher)\n            NV -&gt; UI: Nhap ma giam gia\n            UI -&gt; Ctrl: checkMaGiamGia(maVoucher)\n            Ctrl -&gt; KMEntity: validateVoucher(maVoucher)\n            activate KMEntity\n            KMEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve trang thai Hop le / Het han\n            deactivate KMEntity\n        end\n        \n        Ctrl -&gt; Ctrl: Tinh toan tong tien tam tinh\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi gio hang &amp; \&quot;Chiet khau khuyen mai\&quot;\n    end\n    deactivate Ctrl\n    \n    &#39; UC 4: Lập hóa đơn &amp; Ghi nhận thanh toán\n    NV -&gt; UI: Nhap so tien khach dua, chon Phuong thuc TT &amp; bam \&quot;Thanh toan\&quot;\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl: xacNhanThanhToan(chiTietHD, thongTinTT)\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&gt; Ctrl: Tinh tien thua\n    \n    Ctrl -&gt; HDEntity: saveHoaDonGiaoDich(chiTietHD)\n    activate HDEntity\n    HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Xac nhan luu Hoa don\n    deactivate HDEntity\n    \n    Ctrl -&gt; SachEntity: truTonKho(danhSachMua)\n    activate SachEntity\n    SachEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Cap nhat ton kho thanh cong\n    deactivate SachEntity\n    \n    Ctrl --&gt; UI: Ra lenh in hoa don &amp; Thong bao thanh toan thanh cong\n    deactivate Ctrl\n    UI --&gt; NV: Hoan tat giao dich\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; GROUP 2: TRA CỨU HÓA ĐƠN (UC 5)\n&#39; ==========================================\ngroup 2. Tra cuu hoa cu\n    NV -&gt; UI: Chon \&quot;Tra cuu hoa don\&quot; &amp; Nhap tieu chi loc (Ngay, Ma HD...)\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl: traCuuHoaDon(tieuChi)\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&gt; HDEntity: searchHoaDon(tieuChi)\n    activate HDEntity\n    \n    alt Mat ket noi DB\n        HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Loi ket noi\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Bao loi mat ket noi\n    else Binh thuong\n        HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Tra ve danh sach Hoa don\n        deactivate HDEntity\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi danh sach\n        deactivate Ctrl\n        \n        opt Xem chi tiet 1 Hoa don\n            NV -&gt; UI: Click vao 1 Hoa don\n            UI --&gt; NV: Hien thi chi tiet (Sach, Chiet khau, PT Thanh toan)\n        end\n    end\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\n&#39; ==========================================\n&#39; GROUP 3: QUẢN LÝ TRẢ HÀNG / ĐỔI HÀNG (UC 6)\n&#39; ==========================================\ngroup 3. Quan ly tra hang / doi hang\n    NV -&gt; UI: Tu HD cu, chon \&quot;Tao phieu Doi/Tra hang\&quot;\n    activate UI\n    UI -&gt; Ctrl: khoiTaoDoiTra(maHoaDon)\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&gt; HDEntity: kiemTraDieuKienDoiTra(maHoaDon)\n    activate HDEntity\n    \n    alt Vi pham dieu kien (Qua 7 ngay, sach rach...)\n        HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Khong du dieu kien\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao tu choi Doi/Tra\n    else Hop le\n        HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Cho phep Doi/Tra\n        deactivate HDEntity\n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Hien thi form Doi/Tra\n        deactivate Ctrl\n        \n        NV -&gt; UI: Quet ma sach moi (Neu doi) &amp; Bam xac nhan\n        UI -&gt; Ctrl: xuLyDoiTra(thongTinDoiTra)\n        activate Ctrl\n        Ctrl -&gt; Ctrl: Tinh toan chenh lech gia (Can bu/Thoi lai)\n        \n        Ctrl -&gt; HDEntity: savePhieuDoiTra()\n        activate HDEntity\n        HDEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Xac nhan luu giao dich\n        deactivate HDEntity\n        \n        Ctrl -&gt; SachEntity: capNhatTonKhoDoiTra(sachCu, sachMoi)\n        activate SachEntity\n        SachEntity --&gt; Ctrl: Hoan tat cap nhat kho\n        deactivate SachEntity\n        \n        Ctrl --&gt; UI: Thong bao hoan tat &amp; In bien ban\n        deactivate Ctrl\n    end\n    UI --&gt; NV: Dong quy trinh Doi/Tra\n    deactivate UI\nend\n\ndeactivate NV\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="0BV4m-X-jLDrs18xr2r9-1">
